1300 GOSUB 6360:BM$="Vince: I think Susanna's waiting for someone.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1310 GOSUB 6350:BM$="Clark: No shit. Why else would she come all the way here?":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1320 GOSUB 6360:BM$="Vince: Whoever they are, they're not here yet.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1330 GOSUB 6350:BM$="Clark: Did the other party get the time wrong? It's been almost one hour.":GOSUB 5100
1340 GOSUB 9545:BM$="Right then, Clark's pager rang.":GOSUB 5100:GOSUB 9565
1350 BM$="Clark: I gotta find a phone. The client just send me some weird stuff.\Sometimes I feel like I'm a dog on their leash...":GOSUB 5100
1360 BM$="Clark: I'll go make this call. Stay here and keep an eye on her. If anything\happens call me on the walkie-talkie.":GOSUB 5100
1370 GOSUB 6360:BM$="Clark left, running towards the sightseeing ship terminal.":GOSUB 5100
1380 BM$="After a while, he returned.":GOSUB 5100
1390 GOSUB 6350:BM$="Clark: Well? Where's Susanna's mysterious date?":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
