1430 GOSUB 6350:BM$="Clark: Looks like the cab's going back to the hotel. Did she really just go out\for a walk...?":GOSUB 5100
1440 W6=0:GOSUB 6200:GOSUB 6350:BM$="The cab stopped in front of the hotel. Susanna got off and went directly\inside.":GOSUB 5100
1450 BM$="Clark: There she goes... Stakeout ends here today. Let's go back to the\office.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1455 GOSUB 6210:GOSUB 6360:BM$="Vince: This is about that phone call, right? What did they tell you?":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1460 GOSUB 6350:BM$="Clark: They want me to look into that ring David's wearing. I want to look\through all the photos we took of him in Europe, maybe we can figure\something out.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1470 GOSUB 6360:BM$="Vince: So David's part of the Big Susanna Mystery?":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
