1700 BM$="Vince: The client must have noticed the ring during the broadcast of last\night's concert on TV. I wish they told us what they knew about it, though.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1710 BM$="Clark: The ring's a mystery, the Devil King's a mystery, whatever they\want to know about Susanna's a mystery... I feel like we're getting involved\in something nasty.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1720 BM$="Vince: I've been mainly taking photos of David's face. I'm not sure we have\any close-ups of his hand.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1730 BM$="Clark: ...I think I got it. The ring he wore during the concert in Germany is\not the same he was wearing in France and Italy.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1740 BM$="Vince: Hey, you're right. This one has some kind of coat of arms on it. The\one he was wearing before had an angular design. The photos from last\night's concert haven't been developed yet...":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1750 BM$="Clark: Then get to it. And have them enlarge the photos that show the ring!\Give 'em a nice tip to make 'em hurry.":GOSUB 5100
1760 GOSUB 6150:GOSUB 9555:BM$="Vince took the film out of the camera and left the room.":GOSUB 5100
1770 BM$="Clark took his copy of the report he sent the client and read it again,\taking notes as he went.":GOSUB 5100
1775 GOSUB 6160:BM$="Then, he put a tape in his recorder, and started listening intently.":GOSUB 5100
1780 BM$="After a while, Clark was brewing tea, smiling as he hummed David's song.":GOSUB 5100
1790 GOSUB 9555:GOSUB 6165:BM$="Two hours later, Vince came back.":GOSUB 5100
1800 BM$="Clark: Good work. I made tea, why don't you have a cup?":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1810 BM$="Vince: YOU made tea, Chief? That's a new one... I noticed you're smiling. Did\you figure something out?":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1820 BM$="Clark: The mystery of the ring's definitely related to David. Remember\that conversation between Susanna and Gockel we intercepted in\Hameln?":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1830 BM$="Vince: Yeah, it was that time I had to eat fish. I hate fish. I'd never forget\that.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1840 BM$="Clark: That time, Gockel gave Susanna `something`. While we couldn't see it,\I'm convinced it was the ring David's wearing now.":GOSUB 5100
1850 BM$="Clark: They were also talking about the `Devil King` and the `Blood of the\Betrayer`. I've listened to the tape again, and my gut tells me the `Devil\King` they talked about is David.":GOSUB 5100
1860 BM$="Clark: Of course they never say that outright, but I think I'm on to\something.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1870 BM$="Vince: Well, I definitely never heard anyone refer to David with that kind\of nickname, but let's say you're right: what would it mean?":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1880 GOSUB 6220:BM$="Clark: It means we send these photos and the tape to the client. Maybe\this'll lead us to something. Considering the money they're willing to shell\out, this case must be bigger than it seems.":GOSUB 5100
1890 BM$="Clark was talking to Vince as if he was expecting something to happen.":GOSUB 5100
